{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026oZAngjBkhh1793678278.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中證監會副主席李超指，將全力維護資本市場平穩運行，推動中長期資金入市穩步提升。</p><p></p><p>中國證監會副主席李超說︰「全力維護資本市場平穩運行，今年以來，面對多重超預期輸入性風險挑戰，密切加強監測監控和穩實機制建設，著力夯實市場穩的基礎，進一步健全長錢長投制度生態，深入推進公募基金改革，推動社保、年金、保險等中長期資金入市規模，和比例穩步提升。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:03:31.997153+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T03:05:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T12:38:20.097437+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:59:17.779410+00:00","content_hash":"a626f66ebd21f7113ceda0a6983a55b2fe06ea48a009613da9ecfb1609dec348","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:03:31.997153+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}